window.products.push({"id":895132,"name":"Ceramic Butter Crock with Water for Counter - Porcelain French Butter Dish with Lid for Countertop, Round Butter Keeper Container with Cover for Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ItBFQEsCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT SPREADABLE BUTTER: Having the water at room temperature in the bottom of your butter crock with lid allows you to keep your butter or ghee fresh and spreadable for longer. Giving you the perfect spread you crave. Change the water 2-3 days so to make sure that the butter crock will keep butter at room temperature for as long as thirty days LOCK-IN FRESHNESS: This porcelain butter keeper is unique from the other butter dishes you will find. The water at the bottom of the container offers a protective layer and a strong seal. This is very important to prevent the air from getting to the butter, helping to keep it fresh and easily spreadable for a couple of weeks. In this way, the butter crock gives you that perfect room temperature butter, ready and waiting at all times, without having to worry about it is not fresh TIPS: Let the butter reach room temperature and then open the packaging. Use a spoon to put the butter securely in the lid and then place in the crock with cold water. You can add some salt on the bottom of the jar to prevent it from spoiling in the water. When the butter is placed securely in the lid, it won't fall out of the crock EASY TO CLEAN: The butter crock for counter is made from high quality porcelain that was fired at a high temperature. The enamel surface of the french butter dish is smooth and can be cleaned by hand or in a dishwasher Decorative: You can choose from a variety of colors. The simple and stylish appearance of the butter keeper for counter can be matched to your personal style and current tableware. The french butter dish also makes a great gift for weddings, housewarmings, Christmas, and birthdays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ItBFQEsCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIPMEN","source_asin":"B09722TLY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09722TLY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09722TLY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
