window.products.push({"id":895260,"name":"Turkish Towel Fishbone Pattern Peshtemal ,Quick-Dry, Cotton, Absorbent - Multifunctional (1 Piece, Coral)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710xPEpbtBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS PESHTEMAL? A peshtemal is a traditional Turkish towel used in Turkish baths. A staple of Ottoman hammam culture, dating back hundreds of years, the peshtemal was originally designed to help individual bathers maintain their privacy. It is highly absorbent, dry faster than standard towels. WHEN/WHERE DO YOU USE THIS PESTEMAL? -ANYTIME, ANYWHERE!  Peshtemals have become extremely popular in the World. You’ll love to make it bath towels, but beside of this, you can cover-up your body with this at the beach, pool or spa.  Of course, not only that! They look fabulous around the home as a decorative throw, light blanket, or table covering. Also, they will have become an essential part of your travels, because they are thin, air dry super quick and take up almost no space.  So, you can use them for whatever you need, whenever you need them. Here are the more ways to use Peshtemals: Stroller Cover Stroller Cover Picnic Blanket Picnic Blanket Patio Blanket Patio Blanket Sofa/Chair Cover Sofa/Chair Cover Yoga Mat / Yoga Mat Cover Yoga Mat / Yoga Mat Cover Travel Blanket for The Plane Travel Blanket for The Plane Seat Cover in the Car Seat Cover in the Car Hair Towel Hair Towel Scarf Scarf Nursing Cover Nursing Cover Sarong Sarong","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710xPEpbtBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indulge Turkish Linen","source_asin":"B07NF868BL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NF868BL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NF868BL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
