window.products.push({"id":895320,"name":"LoiStu Christmas Tree Skirt, 30inch White Plush Xmas Tree Skirt Mat Base Cover for Merry Christmas Decor & Home Decorations(30inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JvoSUjnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Different Choices: The tree skirt is available in two sizes: 30\" and 36\" in diameter. You can choose a suitable Christmas tree skirt according to the size of the Christmas tree to dress up your Christmas tree. High Quality：This Christmas tree skirt is made of high-quality plush and non-woven fabric, soft and comfortable, and impeccable craftsmanship. Unique Design: Double-layer design, suitable for Christmas trees of different sizes. Soft and warm, a favorite place for pets in winter, add a Christmas atmosphere to your home. At the opening, stick three Velcro tapes to the bottom of the Christmas tree, and the tree skirt can be fixed under the Christmas tree without knotting and fold neatly to store Christmas decorations. Reusable: The artificial fur of the Christmas tree skirt is durable. After Christmas, maybe you can use it as a rug among writers, or fold it and store it for next year. (Note: It is best to wash and air dry with cold water.) Note: The tree skirt is vacuum-packed, which will make the hair of the tree skirt not fluffy enough. You only need to blow the hair of the tree skirt with your hair and then the dryer can be used. Scope of Application: The Christmas tree skirt is warm and soft. It is a perfect Christmas decoration and an ideal Christmas gift. You can decorate your Christmas tree with exquisite decorations at home, school, shop, office, supermarket, etc., to make the whole house full of festive atmosphere. Bring home the joy of Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JvoSUjnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LoiStu","source_asin":"B09CYSQ8Y1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYSQ8Y1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYSQ8Y1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
