window.products.push({"id":895418,"name":"Forias Single Leg Elevation Pillow for After Surgery Memory Foam Leg Pillow for Sleeping with Dual Handles Non-Slip Leg Knee Support and Elevation Pil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-3WTjkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-quality Material】: Forias memory foam leg elevation pillow is made from high-density foam construction which allows for optimal support and comfort! Certificated by CertiPUR-US and Standard 100 by Oeko - Tex. Selected skin-friendly air layer polyester cover, featuring soft, breathable and skin-friendly, removable and machine washable that is easy to clean and maintain. 【Ergonomic Design】: Forias leg wedge pillow for after surgery adopts 4.7\" breathable memory foam top and 4.7\" high density foam core to ensure the better comfort and great support. Designed with a 40º incline, the leg elevation pillow for swelling provides the most suitable elevation height for the leg, promoting blood circulation and reducing leg pain. The U-shaped groove makes the leg in place to avoid slipping off when sleeping. 【Well-designed Wedge Shape】: The wedge-shaped knee surgery pillow helps to elevate your legs and knees at the perfect angle, allowing you to relax and unwind in comfort. Use this leg wedge pillow to get the ultimate comfort while watching TV, reading, or just lounging in bed. Leg support pillow to elevate feet can also be used to help improve circulation and reduce muscle fatigue. 29\"/19\"X13\"X9.5\"(L*W*H) 【Relieves Swelling and Discomfort】: Specifically designed for legs, knees and injured ankles. This leg elevation pillow for circulation must be the best after-surgery gift for those who suffer from conditions such as varicose veins, lymphedema, edema, or after surgeries like femur replacement, ACL surgery, posterior tibial tendon dysfunction, or knee/hip replacement. 【Smart Dual Handles】: Our leg elevation pillow for after surgery is designed with 2 handles, one is for carrying it everywhere and the other one makes it easier to reposition while you're relaxing on the couch or sleeping in the bed! The non-slip bottom design helps to prevent the leg pillow from moving during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-3WTjkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Forias","source_asin":"B0BLC6C8NV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLC6C8NV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLC6C8NV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
