window.products.push({"id":895444,"name":"Kinglooyuan LOOYUAN Large Size Luxury Modern 3D Frameless Large Wall Clock Style Watches Hours DIY Room Home Decoration Mirror Surface","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oQ-hPdB+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Specifications:  Suitable place: Smooth walls of Living room, kids bedroom, dining room, kitchen, office, bathroom, outdoor  Battery: AA 1.5V battery(Battery Not Included)  Product Features:  1.The wall clock is 3D effect,  2.Waterproof EVA foam material,use eco friendly material;  3.DIY distance from different digits, and DIY shape of the digits  4.Easy to install and remove the sticker;  5.It is self-adhesive, water & steam resistant, Non toxic and safety for the children;  6.Silent sweeping movement, mute movement,Silent Clock give you a quiet night.  7.The decals can be applied on all smooth surfaces,such as Walls, Doors, Windows, Closets, Plastic, Metal, Tiles etc.  8.Reasonable price and high quality,pass CE certification.  Warm Tips:  This product is suitable for smooth walls,gray walls or wallpaper wall will cause the adhesive properties of the surface behind stickers decrease.  Part of the wallpaper or easy to swap gray walls, please bring your own strong ticky glue for auxiliary installations. How to Install?  STEP1:Remove all dirt and dust from the application surface and make sure the surface is dry and clean.  STEP2:Cover the clock with the auxiliary scale,as to the scale,stick the figure at the right site.  STEP3:Take down the clock,fixing the hour hand and minute hand one bye one.Tips:press the hands into the clock axes in order aim at 12 o'clock . STEP4:Adjust the time with the buttom and install the battery.  STEP5:Hanging the clock return to the nail. STEP6:Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now.  Package Includes :  1x Clock stickers  1x Clock mechanism  1 wall clock","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oQ-hPdB+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinglooyuan","source_asin":"B0177QKE5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0177QKE5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0177QKE5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":895445,"name":"Jaxx Zipline Sofa Large Ottoman 3 in 1 Fold Out Big Kids Edition, Blueberry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kxi3MvV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s always a miracle when siblings can get along. That’s why the Zipline Kids Sofa is the ultimate peace keeper. Big enough for them to spread out, they can transform the Zipline into any configuration they need—be that reading, watching TV, or playing video games. Perfectly kid-sized, the Sofa gives them their own space for hanging out, and when they want to take their fun to the next level it is easy to place the ottoman in the middle of the sofa and form a table or desk, perfect for board games. For even more play space, lay the sofa out flat and place the ottoman in the center for a generous, comfortable platform for lounging. The lightweight foam core makes it easy for them to flip out and cozy down. Whatever fun and mischief they get up to, your Zipline Sofa will stay as fresh as when you got it because the microsuede cover is removeable and machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kxi3MvV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jaxx","source_asin":"B08KRJ6LYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRJ6LYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRJ6LYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
