window.products.push({"id":895499,"name":"Amazingware Royal Teapot, Porcelain Tea Pot with Stainless Steel Infuser, with a Filter for Loose Tea, Pumpkin Fluted Shape - 28oz, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7173xlGIbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CERAMICS CAN MAINTAIN THE FLAVOR OF TEA WELL! - The teapot is made of fine ceramics and has a good insulation effect so that the tea can exert the best taste. HIGH QUALITY PORCELAIN - The teapot is safe food, durable, and suitable for everyday use. Ceramics have the safety of microwave ovens and dishwashers. ENJOY TEA TIME WITH FAMILY AND FRIENDS - It is about 28 oz. Just a suitable size for you, your family, and your friends to have good tea time. CLASSIC DESIGN - British royal style design, pumpkin shape and border decoration. More elegant and noble. It will impress you and your guests. WHAT A NICE AND ELEGANT GIFT! - This teapot is perfect for birthdays, baby showers, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, weddings, and other important days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7173xlGIbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazingware","source_asin":"B07ZSDL1WV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSDL1WV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSDL1WV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":895500,"name":"Woven Wicker Baskets with Compartments (Set of 2 Storage Baskets): Rustic Woven Hampers for Storage, Farmhouse Style Small Storage Bins, Versatile Wov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812uYpIxrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep everything in its place with our woven wicker baskets with compartments. Made with stylish cotton rope, our woven pantry organization and storage baskets are a fabulous way to get your home organized while adding a decorative touch to each room. Available in a natural tan wicker color, these chic rope small baskets blend in beautifully with any style of decor. Each wicker laundry basket set comes with two different pantry basket designs: one with an open storage compartment and another with a built-in divider. The basket for organizing with a divider is ideal in the living room for holding magazines, reading glasses, and remotes, or in the craft room for tidying up paper, fabric, wool, and crafting tools. The other laundry basket is open enough to hold everything from bathroom linens, beauty products, and electronics to pantry staples, clothing, and toys. No matter how you decide to use our storage bins, all of them come with a simple yet elegant look that is designed for both style and durability. Each rectangular bathroom basket for organizing is built to last with strong woven rope that gives it a sturdy and reliable construction. The woven baskets for storage also come with convenient handles that make them as portable as they are practical. You will be surprised how many rooms these rustic farmhouse pantry storage bins can be used in. They are lovely for keeping everything neat and tidy in the kitchen, pantry, laundry room, office, or bedroom. These versatile bathroom baskets with compartments are great for storing arts and craft supplies, sewing notions, or knitting supplies in your hobby room, or keeping your favorite reading materials, tablet, and charging cables within reach next to your office reading chair. Whether they are containing clutter on your bathroom countertop or keeping linens neat and tidy in your closet, these large baskets for storage give all your odds and ends a place to call home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812uYpIxrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLPR","source_asin":"B07C7C48KZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C7C48KZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C7C48KZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
