window.products.push({"id":895700,"name":"Presto 07037 Jumbo Cool Touch Electric Griddle, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314GP030RRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The most important meal of the day just gets better with this Presto Cool-Touch griddle. It has a powerful 1500-watt heat element with 120V AC and a fully immersible cooking surface for easy cleanup. The griddle’s cool touch base surrounds the grilling surface and its nonstick finish makes cooking and cleaning clean and easy. Includes a slide-out drip tray and Control Master automatic heat control. Made of heavy-cast aluminum with a nonstick finish. Imported. 3-1/2Hx20-1/2Wx10-1/2L”. Amazon.com Cooking breakfast for a crowd? This huge 10-1/2-by-20-1/2-inch griddle can handle French toast, hash brown potatoes, and sausages all at once, without requiring you to dirty several pans. The griddle isnt limited to breakfast either--it grills up plenty of hot dogs, hamburgers, or grilled cheeses for a kids birthday party or serves as a warmer for adult buffet-style entertaining. The heat control ranges from 200 to 400 degrees Fahrenheit (in 50-degree increments) and automatically maintains the proper heat setting so foods cook at the same rate as they would on the stove but in a more energy-efficient manner than a range or oven. The griddles surface is made of heavy cast-iron aluminum, which heats evenly and is resistant to warping. The nonstick surface ensures that food lifts off the griddle effortlessly and that cleanup is easy. A built-in ledge around the entire griddle surface provides a backstop for flipping pancakes or eggs, and a drip tray beneath the griddle catches grease from bacon or other meats and slides out easily for emptying. The griddle rests within a base that remains cool to the touch on all sides during cooking. With the heat control removed, the griddle is fully immersible in water and dishwasher-safe. Presto covers this electric griddle under a two-year limited warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314GP030RRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Presto","source_asin":"B00006F7C2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006F7C2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006F7C2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
