window.products.push({"id":895729,"name":"DUJUST Black Coffee Mug Set of 4(16oz), Modern & Stylish Design with Handcrafted Golden Trims, Black and Gold Cup Set for Coffee, Tea & Milk, Beautifu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717zRuZ0cvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Shinning Black in Golden Trim】We derive the modern design inspiration from mugs dedicated to European aristocrats for hundreds of years and perfectly integrate contemporary aesthetic trends. The handcrafted golden trims also are the finishing touch of the product. They are a shiny black design, simple and elegant. it can be a great coffee or tea set for entertainment with your friends, an elegant way to enjoy your life. 【Top Fine Porcelain, Durable & Stable】All the pieces of the mug set are made of high-quality porcelain clay, which is food-safe and lead-free. The Edge comes with German Heraeus gold glaze, an upgraded artwork for your daily use. Our mug set has a beautiful shape, a shnning color, and a smooth texture. 【Perfect Gift Idea and Home Decor】 The lbeautiful mug set makes the perfect gift for occasions like Mother's Day, weddings, anniversaries, Christmas, Valentines, birthdays, or other gift-giving opportunities. The modern black design also makes a great home decor, you will surely enjoy having guests with this set on your table, not matter with black tea, green tea, flower tea, milk or coffee. Newly upgraded EPE foam, which is a much safer package, and better for the environment. 【Limmitation: Non-Microwave-Safe】The gold trim of the products is made of German Heraeus gold glaze, giving it a high quality and elegant look. The real gold in it may cause an electric arc in the microwave oven, which may damage the product itself, as well as the microwave oven. We do not recommend using it in the microwave oven. And please do not use sharp objects to wipe the product, which may scratch the trim. 【90 Days Money Back with 1 Year Warranty】 DUJUST is committed to providing our customers with high-quality exquisite mug sets. And we ensure your satisfaction. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us, we are always keeping active to solve your problem. We try our best to provide you with the best quality and service, and we provide you with 90 days money back service with 1 year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717zRuZ0cvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUJUST","source_asin":"B092JH98QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JH98QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JH98QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
