window.products.push({"id":895858,"name":"Yeti Letter Decal, Your Choice of Color & Style | Decals by ADavis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718U0MAtGrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized for YOU A decal is a great way to add some character to your cup & stand out in the crowd. But why would you want to add a generic decal that countless other people have? You don't! Well, I'm here to help. All of our decals can be personalized and customized to fit your taste Applying the decal is a breeze This is probably the most asked question. How hard is it to apply the decal to the cup? The answer...super easy! Every order comes with easy to follow steps that will have your decal on your cup in less than 5 minutes. Can I use this decal on something other than a Yeti? The simple answer...yes! Your decal will work on any hard, smooth, non porous surface. Just make sure you choose the right size for where you want the decal to go. There are many different places your decal can be used. Some of those are cups, water bottles, wine glasses, phone cases, laptops, notebooks, etc. Permanent decals should not be used on walls or fabric. What size do I order? Size needed can vary based on brand, size & sometimes even color of the cup. For this reason, I always suggest measuring the area you want the decal to go and ordering the best size for you.  Click the Customize Now Button to Buy Now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718U0MAtGrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decals by ADavis","source_asin":"B079MFNPTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-895858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MFNPTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MFNPTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
